  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you add a VideoStream panel to your world (I tested with YouTube), and it is off by default, then trying to turn it on with an enable trigger won't work.\n\nWhat you need to do, is to turn it on, turn it off and then turn it on again. (Requires a bit of waiting between each action)\n\nThis makes it so worlds that want to do cool things when users click a button, or allow them to choose video/music from a list - won't work properly.",
